<h2 id="writing-types">Writing Types </h2>
<a href="#top">top</a>
<p>The following describes the list of writing types available on FreeCreate, and the rationale behind including them.</p>
<p>We hope to expand these types in the future to include more types of writing, such as journalism and general non-fiction.</p>
<p>However, since we're a small team at present, we only want to include writing types that are clearly fictional, or clearly matters of personal experience and opinion.</p>
<p>Allowing for writing types like Non-Fiction and Journalism would lend a certain degree of credibility to pieces of writing that we simply do not have the capacity to verify ourselves at the given time.</p>
<p>If you do want to use our platform to do this kind of writing, you obviously still can, most probably under the title of essay, blog, or thought piece.</p>
<p>As with any sort of case where you're discussing real world things or trying to make some kind of point that bears on concrete reality, we recommend you cite your sources.</p>
<p>We also recognize that we're classifying all "Poetry" under the same umbrella for now. We know that this might seem insufficient, and we'll work to expand our selection in the future.</p>
<h3>Short Stories</h3>
<p>Typically speaking, a short story is under 10,000 words or so. We don't enforce this rule, but if you're wondering how to categorize what you're writing, 10,000 words or less is what we would consider a short story.</p>
<h3>Novellettes</h3>
<p>Novellette's are the next shortest form of fiction writing, and typically range between 10,000 and 25,000 words. Like short stories, this isn't a hard and fast rule - if you think something slightly shorter or slightly longer deserves this title, or something with a lower word count but a high number of chapters, that's your prerogative. The end goal of all this is creative freedom, not rigid categorization!</p>
<h3>Novellas</h3>
<p>We consider novellas to be between 25,000 and 50,000 words, as a general rule of thumb.</p>
<h3>Novels</h3>
<p>Novels are considered anything above 50,000 words, or thereabouts.</p>


